        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "          7    Ai Ruina Thay the, Kachangc Changhna",
            "                                  9.9.9.9. Ref. 9.9.9.9",
            "          Doh hei Ab",
            "",
            "          1. Ai ruina thay the kachangc changhna,",
            "             Mi ’baanv kandih hei akai hamh e,",
            "             Neih khatna ’gin guanglou kumh tuang de;",
            "             Neih khatna ’gin guanglou kumh tuang de.",
            "",
            "                  Tingsaengc lak khe, ai han dat ni the,",
            "                  Neihlaamei tingkauh akai thangctei;",
            "                  Tingkauh baanch’raa guay lev bam ’chamcna,",
            "                  Neihlaa zaenggay lu suan ’cham ni the.",
            "",
            "          2. Alungning syng khou Poubauhmei lat,",
            "             Guang pwthe trampet amuan kumcna,",
            "             Amuan guangmei khwantei rui saa e:",
            "             Tingkauh kandih tei ’naaguang pwthe.",
            "",
            "          3. Kandih khou naimei ataanv kaguay,",
            "             Alatsav guay amaan pwni e,",
            "             Poubauhmei tingsaeng ringhmei Lat mu,",
            "             Khatsihnic amaan ni tuang hamh e.",
            "",
            "          4. Ryanraa’ guay nthaekc pwni neihkhat;",
            "             Tingkauh kandic tei tangc pwkhou kiu,",
            "             Suan bammei aluswan kaguay hei,",
            "             Neihlaana tingkauh thangc suan dat ni."
          ]
        }
      }
